<speak>
<s>This is your briefing for <say-as interpret-as="date" format="dmy">27052026</say-as>.</s>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="95%">
<s>Hours after the Doha track resumed, United States Central Command struck missile sites in Iran's Hormozgan province, and Tehran says the ceasefire is already broken.</s> <s>Washington called the strikes self-defensive, even as Secretary Rubio insisted a deal was a few days away and frozen-asset talks continued in Qatar.</s> <s>Iran's Revolutionary Guards downed an American drone in reply, and the Strait of Hormuz remains, for now, closed to commercial shipping.</s>
</prosody>
<p>
<s>In politics.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The United States and Armenia signed a strategic partnership agreement on Tuesday, weeks before Armenians vote.</s> <s>The deal pairs critical-minerals cooperation with a forty-three kilometre transit corridor through southern Armenia that bypasses both Russia and Iran to reach Turkey, and Moscow has threatened consequences if it opens.</s> <s>Washington is, in effect, putting its signature on Yerevan's pivot away from the Russian-led security bloc, and Tehran is reading every line.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Bellingcat investigators have geolocated unexploded Russian cluster bomblets in a village fifty-five kilometres south of Aguelhok, in northern Mali.</s> <s>Mali is a state party to the Convention on Cluster Munitions, and Russia's Africa Corps is the supplier; the village is too small for any United Nations body to name in protest.</s> <s>No party has so far been referred for the violation, and the documented craters remain the only accountability anyone has produced.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Nine countries have walked away from the Czech ammunition coalition for Ukraine, halving its membership since Prime Minister Babis took office in December.</s> <s>President Petr Pavel says the initiative still delivers half of Ukraine's large-calibre shells, but there's no replacement waiting, and even Russian state media is carrying the story straight.</s> <s>A coalition of the willing, it turns out, lasts only as long as the most recent election allows.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Nigeria's Akwa Ibom state, sixteen market shops burned to the ground one hundred and six metres from a fire station that had received no diesel for two months.</s> <s>The state took in three hundred and ninety-seven billion naira in the first quarter of this year, and it has three functional fire trucks for its entire territory.</s> <s>State capacity, as Premium Times rendered it, is not abstract — it's whether the truck has fuel on the day the market burns.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Cairo, the United Nations refugee agency cut non-emergency care for Egypt's one and a half million Sudanese refugees after receiving less than thirty percent of required funding.</s> <s>A suburban clinic that New Lines visited now logs three to four suicide attempts per shift, and a twenty-one year old named Omar Nourain, who survived Sudan's war, did not survive Cairo.</s> <s>No donor has yet committed to restoring the cut, in sha'Allah it will come before the next clinic closes.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>On the economy.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>South Korea's SK Hynix now holds fifty-seven percent of global revenue in high-bandwidth memory, the chips that feed every serious artificial-intelligence model.</s> <s>Samsung trails at twenty-two percent and Micron at twenty-one, because each new generation demands deeper co-design with Nvidia, and the yield gap compounds with every node.</s> <s>The world's AI build-out now rests on two single-country chokepoints — logic from Taiwan, memory from Korea — whose valuations dwarf entire national markets.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Speaking of which, India's market regulator has called Taiwan's four point nine five trillion dollar market capitalisation a one-stock story.</s> <s>The island's valuation tracks TSMC and the AI supply chain rather than any broad sector, and its lead over India shifts with every quarterly ranking.</s> <s>What looks like a national equity market is, increasingly, a single company priced against the appetite of a single American customer.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Prime Minister Modi's Nordic tour this week was India's opening move for Arctic credentials — rare earths, polar shipping lanes, scientific stations.</s> <s>But the only northern route runs through Russian-controlled waters, and Delhi cannot use it without straining the Moscow relationship it has spent two years defending.</s> <s>No Arctic framework emerged from the visit, and the contradiction is now the policy.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Malta, a single compromised cryptographic key let an attacker mint thirteen and a half million dollars in unbacked stablecoins from the issuer StablR.</s> <s>The firm's multisignature wallet required only one of three owners to approve a mint, and the intruder simply added themselves as admin and offloaded the tokens for two point eight million in real money.</s> <s>StablR's euro-pegged token now trades at fifty-five cents against a euro worth one dollar fourteen, a peg broken by a permissions setting.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In science.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>Five hundred Bangladeshi children have died of measles since March, and the health ministry counts sixty thousand suspected cases.</s> <s>The interim government's twenty twenty-four procurement shift caused vaccine delays that <sub alias="the United Nations Children's Fund">UNICEF</sub> warned against ten times at senior level, and Eid travel now threatens to spread the outbreak further.</s> <s>Measles is a herd-immunity disease eliminable with a one-dollar dose, and the children are dying of a budget decision.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>India's airport surveillance flagged a Ugandan traveller arriving in Bengaluru last week with fatigue consistent with Ebola, and she's now isolated at Karnataka's state epidemic hospital.</s> <s>Samples have gone to the National Institute of Virology in Pune, and the World Health Organization continues to flag Uganda for active monitoring.</s> <s>The unsexy post-twenty-fourteen public-health upgrade — catch the case at the gate — actually worked, and that's the headline most catches never get.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>In Yemen's capital Sana'a, cholera, dengue, and respiratory illness are converging in the same neighbourhoods at the same time.</s> <s>The World Health Organization says Yemen carried the world's highest cholera burden last year, and war-damaged drainage now creates the standing pools where dengue mosquitoes breed.</s> <s>Cholera peaks every harvest as unsafe irrigation water is reused, and no international agency has the funding to interrupt either cycle.</s>
</p>
<p>
<s>In technology.</s><break time="400ms"/>
<s>The Social Media Exchange in Beirut has documented that Lebanon's surveillance regime ran uninterrupted through the April ceasefire — internet throttling, account takedowns, and state requests to platforms continued in full.</s> <s>Wartime content rules, the group found, simply have no reset; no Middle Eastern state has rolled them back when the bombs stopped.</s> <s>The ceasefire paused the kinetic war, and left the digital one running.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>A single malformed character in an HTTP Host header now bypasses authentication on Starlette, the server underneath FastAPI, vLLM, and LiteLLM.</s> <s>The flaw, catalogued as CVE twenty twenty-six dash four eight seven one zero, exposes any Model Context Protocol deployment, including clinical databases and corporate mailboxes wired to artificial-intelligence agents.</s> <s>Starlette one point zero point one patches it, but the inventory of who's actually patched is, as ever, much shorter than the inventory of who's exposed.</s>
<break time="600ms"/>
<s>Russia's Security Council has added Rostec's cybersecurity chief, Andrei Kozlov, to its standing staff on Friday.</s> <s>Kozlov ran a division with alleged ties to military intelligence, and the appointment places offensive cyber operations and the defence-industrial base under a single secretariat.</s> <s>No government has publicly responded, which is itself the response.</s>
</p>
<break time="1s"/>
<prosody rate="90%">
<s>That's your briefing.</s>
</prosody>
</speak>